---
// millpond's status, said once wherever it is shown: designed, not built.
---

<p class="status not-content">
  <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span><strong>Designed, not built.</strong> The design is settled in agentplot/blueprints; no code exists yet.</span>
</p>

<style>
  .status {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--millpond-accent) 55%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
  }
  .dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--millpond-accent);
    transform: translateY(0.05rem);
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
</style>
